\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s1\sb360\sa80\sl252\slmult1 Feature Requirements\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\fs28 Guest User Access\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Guest User, I should be able to start an AI Coach interaction without registering, so that I can receive immediate guidance.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 A Guest User should be able to initiate an AI Coach interaction without creating an account.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}A Guest User must be prompted to select a coaching persona before the interaction begins.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The AI Coach should only function in text mode for Guest Users.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Conversational memory should not persist beyond the current session for Guest Users. A session ends when the browser tab or app view is closed, refreshed, or inactive beyond a system-defined timeout. \par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Sign-Up Prompt for Guest Users\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Guest User, I should be encouraged to sign up, so that the AI Coach can provide more personalized and continuous guidance.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 During or after an AI Coach interaction, a Guest User should see a sign-up prompt. The prompt should be shown at most once per session unless the user initiates a new AI Coach interaction.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The prompt text must read exactly:\line\ldblquote We\rquote re here to support you.\line Sign up to get guidance that\rquote s tailored for you.\rdblquote\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The prompt should include a clear call to action to sign up or log in with prompts:\line\ldblquote No Thanks. Maybe Later\rdblquote\line\ldblquote Yes, I Want Personalized Guidance\rdblquote\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Dismissing the prompt should allow the Guest User to continue the current session.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Persona Selection\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a User, I should be able to select a coaching persona, so that the guidance I receive aligns with my preferred coaching style.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 All users must select a coaching persona before interacting with the AI Coach. Returning registered users with a previously selected persona should not be prompted again unless they choose to switch personas.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The system should display nine available personas.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Each persona should display a default name, image, and description.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The selected persona should persist across sessions for Free and Paying Members only.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Switch Coaching Persona\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a User, I should be able to switch the coaching persona at any time, so that the AI Coach\rquote s guidance style better matches my current needs or preferences.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 A User should be able to access the option to switch coaching persona during an active AI Coach interaction.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}When the User chooses to switch personas, the system should display the full list of available personas.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Each persona in the list should display its name, image, and description.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}After selecting a new persona, the AI Coach should immediately adopt the newly selected persona\rquote s coaching style for all subsequent responses.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The AI Coach should use the selected persona\rquote s default voice style and description, while retaining any user-configured settings such as the customized AI Coach name and voice speaking speed.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The selected persona should persist across sessions for registered users (Free Members and Paying Members).\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab} Guest Users should retain the selected persona only for the duration of the current session.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Switching the coaching persona should not interrupt the current session or cause loss of conversational context within the session.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Conversational memory should persist across persona switches, unless explicitly cleared by the user.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 AI Coach Name Customization\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a User, I should be able to edit the AI Coach\rquote s name, so that the experience feels personal and familiar.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 After selecting a persona, the user should be able to edit the AI Coach\rquote s name.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The input field to change the name should enforce a 9-character limit. The system should prevent additional input beyond this limit and provide immediate visual feedback if exceeded.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The edited name should replace the default persona name in all subsequent interactions.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If the user asks the AI Coach for its name, it should respond using the edited name.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The edited AI Coach name should persist across sessions for registered users only.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Guest Users should retain the edited name only for the duration of the current session.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Text-Based Interaction\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a User, I should be able to enter questions into a text input box, so that I can ask the AI Coach anything using text-based interaction.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 Text-based interactions must be available to all Users, including Guest Users, Free Members, and Paying Members.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The AI Coach interface must display a text input box where the User can type questions or messages.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The text input box must display default placeholder text in a gray style that reads exactly:\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\ldblquote Ask me anything\rdblquote\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1 The placeholder text must disappear when the User begins typing.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Users should be able to send text messages to the AI Coach. \par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Submitting an empty message should be disabled or ignored without error.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The AI Coach should respond using the selected persona\rquote s coaching style.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Text-based interactions should not count toward daily voice response limits.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If the text input box is empty and loses focus, the placeholder text must reappear.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Text-based interactions must not count toward any voice usage limits.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The text input box must remain available even when voice interactions are unavailable or disabled.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Guest User Attempting Voice Interaction\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Guest User, if I attempt to use the voice interaction feature, I should be prompted to sign up or sign in, so that I can access voice-based guidance.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 If a Guest User attempts to initiate a voice interaction, the system should block the action.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The system should display a prompt encouraging the user to sign up or sign in.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The prompt message must read exactly:\line\ldblquote We\rquote re here to support you.\line Sign up to unlock voice conversations and get guidance that\rquote s tailored for you.\rdblquote\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The prompt should include a clear call to action to sign up or log in with prompts:\line\ldblquote No Thanks. Maybe Later\rdblquote\line\ldblquote Yes, I Want Personalized Guidance\rdblquote\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Dismissing the prompt should return the Guest User to text-based interaction.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If the Guest User successfully signs up or logs in, voice interaction should become available immediately without requiring a page refresh.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Voice-Based Interaction (Members)\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Free Member or Paying Member, I should be able to interact with the AI Coach using voice, so that the experience feels natural and conversational.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls2\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 Only Free Members and Paying Members should be able to start and stop voice interactions.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}Voice interactions should be transcribed in real time.\par
{\listtext\f1 2\tab}Users should be able to interrupt the AI Coach while it is speaking.\par
{\listtext\f1 3\tab}If no audio input is detected for 30 seconds, the system should:\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls2\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1 Display a warning message indicating that no audio was detected and that listening has stopped.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}Stop listening\par
{\listtext\f1 2\tab}Release the microphone and speaker\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Persona Configuration (Voice Speed)\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Free Member or Paying Member, I should be able to adjust the AI Coach\rquote s voice speaking speed, so that spoken guidance matches my listening preference.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 Only Free Members and Paying Members should be able to adjust the voice speaking speed for the selected persona.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Voice speaking speed options should be limited to predefined system-supported values.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Changes to voice speaking speed should take effect immediately for voice interactions.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The selected voice speaking speed should persist across sessions for registered users only.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Guest Users should not be able to adjust voice speaking speed.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Design Guidance\par

