\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Mute Microphone During Coach Response\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Member, I should be able to mute my microphone while the AI Coach is responding, so that background noise does not interrupt or degrade the response.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 I should see a clearly a microphone icon available whenever a voice-based coaching interaction is active which I can touch to mute the microphone.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If I mute the microphone the device should immediately stop capturing audio from my device.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}While muted, any ambient noise, speech, or accidental sounds from my environment should not be transmitted to or processed by the AI Coach.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If the microphone is muted while the AI Coach is speaking, it\rquote s response should continue uninterrupted and without delay.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}I should see a clear visual indication that my microphone is muted (for example, a crossed-out microphone icon or \ldblquote Muted\rdblquote  state).\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If I select a muted microphone icon, the device should resume capturing audio input from my microphone.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The mute state should apply only to the current interaction session and should not persist across page reloads, app restarts, or new sessions unless explicitly reselected by me.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If my device or browser does not permit microphone access, the mute control should still be visible but disabled, with no impact on the AI Coach\rquote s ability to respond.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Usage Limits for Voice-Based Interaction \par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Free Member or Paying Member, I should be able to use voice-based interactions with the AI Coach within defined limits, so that I can receive spoken guidance while the system enforces fair and predictable usage.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls3\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 Only Free Members and Paying Members may initiate voice-based interactions with the AI Coach.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}Guest Users must not be permitted to initiate voice-based interactions.\par
{\listtext\f1 2\tab}Voice response limits must be enforced on a per-user per-day basis for Free Members and Paying Members.\par
{\listtext\f1 3\tab}The system must support separate, system-configured daily voice response limits for:\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls3\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1 Free Members, with an initial default configuration of 25 responses per user per day\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}Paying Members, with an initial default configuration of 250 responses per user per day\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls3\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1 Daily voice response limit values must be configurable via system configuration and must not be hard-coded in application logic.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}Text-based interactions must not count toward voice response limits for any user type.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Voice Usage Limit Reached\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Free Member or Paying Member, I should be notified when I reach my daily voice interaction limit, so that I understand why voice responses are no longer available and can continue using text-based interactions.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls4\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 The system must detect when a user reaches their daily voice response limit.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}When the daily voice response limit is reached:\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls4\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1 The AI Coach must stop generating spoken responses.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}The system must prevent further voice-based responses for the remainder of the day.\par
{\listtext\f1 2\tab}The system must display a clear message indicating that the daily voice interaction limit has been reached with the following text:\line\ldblquote You\rquote ve reached your voice limit for today. \line You can keep chatting by text. \line Voice will be back tomorrow.\rdblquote\par
{\listtext\f1 3\tab}The user must be able to continue interacting with the AI Coach using text without interruption.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls4\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1 Voice interaction must automatically become available again after the daily limit resets at the start of the next day.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Upgrade Prompt When Free Member Voice Limit Is Reached\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 As a Free Member, when I reach my daily voice interaction limit, I should be given the option to upgrade to a Paying Member, so that I can access additional daily voice interactions.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s3\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\fs24 Acceptance Criteria\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls5\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\fs20 The system must detect when a Free Member reaches their daily voice response limit.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}When the limit is reached, the system must display a message informing the user that voice interactions are no longer available for the remainder of the day.\par
{\listtext\f1 2\tab}The message must include an option to upgrade to a Paying Member with the following text:\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\ls5\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1 Message: \ldblquote Want more voice time?\rdblquote\line Primary Button: \ldblquote Yep, upgrade me\rdblquote\par

\pard\widctlpar\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1 Secondary Button: \ldblquote It\rquote s okay. I\rquote ll keep typing.\rdblquote\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1 The upgrade option must direct the user to the appropriate membership upgrade flow.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Dismissing the upgrade prompt must allow the user to continue interacting with the AI Coach using text-based interactions only.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If the Free Member upgrades successfully, voice interactions must become available immediately, subject to the Paying Member usage limits.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\par
