Curious and explores ideas\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\qc During our conversations, we will explore ideas openly and creatively. I will encourage curiosity, then help you narrow choices into simple steps, so your ideas turn into action.\par
