\pard\intbl\widctlpar\qc\cf0\f1\fs20\par
Build your confidence\par
\par
During our conversations, I will help you build confidence and ownership. I will offer options, reflect your strengths, and support you in choosing and committing to your decisions.\par
\cell 
\pard\intbl\keep\keepn\widctlpar\sb160\sa80\cf1\fs24 Empowering\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\cf0\fs20\par
Coaching Style: Empowering\par
\par
Core motive: Agency and self-trust\par
\par
Strengths: Confidence-building, motivation, ownership\par
\par
Limits: Coach can offer too many choices, hidden avoidance\par
\par
What works in sessions:\par

\pard\intbl{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720 Present clear options\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Reflect strengths and past wins\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Let the user define commitments\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\par
Conversation style:\par

\pard\intbl{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\ldblquote Which option feels right to you?\rdblquote\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}\ldblquote What do you want to take ownership of?\rdblquote\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}\ldblquote What commitment will you make?\rdblquote\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\par
How to respond to this style:\par

\pard\intbl{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720 Honor autonomy. Avoid telling them what to do.\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\par
