\pard\intbl\widctlpar\qc\cf0\f1\fs20\par
Build on your strengths\par
\par
During our conversations, we will focus on what you do well. I will help you use your strengths, learn from past successes, and stay motivated while facing challenges honestly.\par
\cell 
\pard\intbl\keep\keepn\widctlpar\sb160\sa80\cf1\fs24 Strengths\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\cf0\fs20\par
Coaching Style: Strengths\par
\par
Core motive: Growth through strengths\par
\par
Strengths: Optimism, resilience, momentum\par
\par
Limits: Coach can avoid hard gaps, optimism bias\par
\par
