\pard\intbl\widctlpar\qc\cf0\f1\fs20\par
Helps you notice patterns\par
\par
During our conversations, I will help you notice patterns. We may use silence and reflection as I mirror what I observe, allowing insight to emerge without rushing answers.\cell 
\pard\intbl\keep\keepn\widctlpar\sb160\sa80\cf1\fs24 Observational\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\cf0\fs20\par
Coaching Style: Observational\par
\par
Core motive: Awareness and truth\par
\par
Strengths: Pattern recognition, insight, depth\par
\par
Limits: Coach can be silent, discomfort, initial confusion\par
\par
What works in sessions:\par

\pard\intbl{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720 Reflect repeating patterns\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Use few words and allow pauses\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Let insight emerge naturally\par

\pard\intbl\widctlpar\par
Conversation style:\par

\pard\intbl{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\ldblquote I\rquote m noticing a pattern here.\rdblquote\par
