\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s1\sb360\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs32 Appendix B \endash  Coaching Persona Identification and Validation Prompts\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl252\slmult1\cf0\f1\fs20 This appendix provides a structured set of prompts and interpretation guidelines used to identify, differentiate, and validate coaching personas within the AI Coach. The prompts are designed to reveal the AI Coach\rquote s dominant coaching style by observing how it responds to the same underlying situation when framed in different ways. These scenarios may be used by users, product teams, and testers to confirm that each persona consistently exhibits its intended behavior, tone, and decision-making patterns. The goal is to ensure that persona definitions are not only descriptive but observable and testable in live interactions.\par
The suggestion is to ask questions as a user to reveal the coaching style.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\widctlpar\s2\sb160\sa80\sl252\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs28 Ownership & Agenda\par

